[{:db/id 17592186192793 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-8b1bfea3-dfec-5d1e-9126-a29ce02c9c56"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-8b1bfea3-dfec-5d1e-9126-a29ce02c9c56" :question/id #uuid "8b1bfea3-dfec-5d1e-9126-a29ce02c9c56" :question/math-academy-id "q-64991" :question/problem "Consider the set $A,$ defined by \n\n$$\nA={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-2\\le x<0,\\,0\\le y<2}\n$$\n\nThe interior of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,,\\,0<y<2\\,}.\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression?" :question/worked-solution "The boundary of a set $A,$ denoted $∂A,$ is the set that contains all the boundary points of $A.$\n\nThe set $A$ and its boundary $∂A$ are shown below.\n\n![](images/71/71851a12f638da9604450cae0d50ed15187e850368890845d60b16b89e728bcf.png)\n\nThe interior of a set $A,$ denoted $\\text{int}\\,A,$ is the set containing all the interior points of $A.$ It contains every point in $A$ except the boundary points: \n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A=A-∂A\n$$\n\nThe interior of $A$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/ab/abdd434da59bb3a1bdc0ee7de398d7ea4aeae2f617f54b5a26a5bad871ba0ac4.png)\n\nSo, in this case, the interior of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-2<x<0,\\,0<y<2\\,}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8f40a659-1e0d-5b32-94de-7b630e906f3f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8f40a659-1e0d-5b32-94de-7b630e906f3f" :answer-field/id #uuid "8f40a659-1e0d-5b32-94de-7b630e906f3f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-75e8591a-dc02-55dc-ad14-ef68af4fe858" :answer-field/choices ["answer-75e8591a-dc02-55dc-ad14-ef68af4fe858" "answer-24a9296e-4eb0-5d98-9be7-848968667f9d" "answer-c0c3ae09-1abc-5587-9c24-5fe509b146bf" "answer-1343a63e-0338-5507-8d29-781c61de7f44" "answer-f99af401-4a27-5bd3-bd62-ea126d8fc033"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-